    Player: "Verish' Ne Verish' ('Believe It or Not') is the Russian version of BS/Cheat. 2-6+ players. Deal all cards. Play face-down declaring rank. Players call 'Ne Veryu!' to challenge. Wrong challengee picks up pile; wrong challenger picks up pile. Shed all cards to win.",
